        "answer": {
          "short": "For $x=-2,-1,0,1,2$, respectively: $f(x)=2,5,6,5,2$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f(-2)&=6-(-2)^2=2\\\\f(-1)&=6-(-1)^2=5\\\\f(0)&=6-0^2=6\\\\f(1)&=6-1^2=5\\\\f(2)&=6-2^2=2\\end{align*}$$",
